   132	## Gate results
   133	
   134	| gate | result | measured evidence |
   135	|---|---|---|
   136	| G1 | pass | 12/12 preset-seed instances verify; 12/12 JSON round trips |
   137	| G2 | pass | drop, swap, duplicate, empty, and bad-step corruptions all rejected with distinct reasons |
