codex
All local gates pass on the first full run. The measured reference decoder solved 8/8 but used about 938,000 instrumented exact operations per hard instance on average; all four no-tool attacks were 0/8, and the compact route topped out at 294 operations. The bare multi-vendor hardening run is now in progress, starting at `easy` as required.
