Implemented the Track B generator and all local verification gates.

Key results:

- G1–G9(c) pass.
- Random guesses: 0/200,000.
- Four attacks: each 0/8.
- Reference decoder: 8/8, averaging 938,121 exact operations.
- Compact finite-difference route: at most 294 operations.
- Canonical-key invariance: 60/60; unrelated instances: 20/20 distinct.
- The family is Track B because Theorem 9 provides polynomial-time fixed-dimensional CVP recovery. [Paper](https://arxiv.org/html/1401.1331v1)

Files:

- [gen_1401_1331.py](/home/gson/gvrepo/results/1401.1331/gen_1401_1331.py)
- [selftest_report.json](/home/gson/gvrepo/results/1401.1331/selftest_report.json)
- [README.md](/home/gson/gvrepo/results/1401.1331/README.md)
