- [placebo transcript](/home/gson/gvrepo/results/1401.1331/g9_placebo_transcript.jsonl)

The remaining blocker is external: the bare `easy` run was solved 1/3 and correctly escalated, but OpenRouter then returned HTTP 403 “Key limit exceeded” before `medium`. Both G9 arms encountered the same quota failure. Consequently, the module is locally verified but does not claim a completed shipping hardness verdict. Replenishing the OpenRouter quota and rerunning `harden.py` is required before submission.
